@step List the saved login-failure diagnostics.
@result aeat --format json config auth diagnostics list
@expect result.row_count == 0
@expect exit_code == 0
@step Inspect one diagnostic by its reference.
@static aeat config auth diagnostics view <diagnostic-id>
@blocked operator-artifact Needs a real login-failure diagnostic, which only a live AEAT auth page-drive produces; the preceding list frame is empty by design, so there is nothing to capture and one must not be fabricated as a fixture.
